# astrion-skill v1
goal: Toggle Wi-Fi on or off
trigger:
  - phrase: "wifi off"
  - phrase: "wifi on"
  - phrase: "toggle wifi"
do: |
  Toggle the Wi-Fi radio via the system.toggleWifi capability. Show
  a notification with the new state and (if connecting) the SSID once
  associated. If turning off and a download is in progress, ask the
  user to confirm via rapid-confirm before proceeding.
constraints:
  level: L2
  budget_tokens: 150
  reversibility: BOUNDED
